<section id="how" class="how-section"><div class="section-wrap"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A SIMPLE WAY IN</p><h2>From “someday” to a little today.</h2><p>No perfect system required. Start with one goal and one next step.</p></div><div class="steps"><article><span>01</span><h3>Name what matters.</h3><p>Choose a goal, whether it’s getting healthier, learning something new, or bringing a project to life.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Make space for it.</h3><p>Put the work on a board. Give routines a place in your week. Invite someone to a board when a little support helps.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Keep a kinder score.</h3><p>Check in, review your progress, and adjust. You’re building a life, not winning a productivity contest.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section-wrap together-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">FOR THE MANY PARTS OF YOU</p><h2>Ambitious at work.<br>Present at home.<br><em>Still making time for you.</em></h2></div><div><p>LifeOS is for people balancing personal goals with everyday responsibilities. A side project. A family plan. The habit you keep meaning to start.</p><p>Share individual boards with friends, family, or collaborators using viewer, reviewer, or editor roles. Your personal timetable and habit history stay separate from board sharing.</p><a class="text-link" href="#request">Make it your own ↗</a></div></section>
<section id="request" class="request-section"><div class="section-wrap request-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE</p><h2>A little more direction.<br>A lot more possibility.</h2><p>Request access to LifeOS. We’re setting up accounts personally while we shape the product with early users.</p><ol class="onboarding"><li><span>1</span><div><strong>Tell us a little about you.</strong><small>Your name, email, and what you’d like to organize.</small></div></li><li><span>2</span><div><strong>We get in touch.</strong><small>We’ll confirm availability, access details, and any pricing before you commit.</small></div></li><li><span>3</span><div><strong>Get your setup, personally.</strong><small>Once confirmed, we’ll prepare your account and send your access instructions.</small></div></li></ol><p class="microcopy">Submitting a request doesn’t create an account or start a subscription.</p></div><form id="accessForm" class="access-form" action="request.php" method="post"><h3>Let’s make room for what matters.</h3><p>Request your invitation. No password or payment details needed.</p><input type="hidden" name="variant" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($variant,ENT_QUOTES,'UTF-8')?>"><div class="form-row"><label>Your name <span>*</span><input name="name" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Alex Morgan"></label><label>Email address <span>*</span><input type="email" name="email" required maxlength="190" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com"></label></div><label>What would you use LifeOS for? <span>*</span><select name="useCase" required><option value="">Choose what fits best</option><option>Personal goals and habits</option><option>Work and personal projects</option><option>Family plans and shared tasks</option><option>A bit of everything</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Who’s joining you?<select name="people"><option>Just me</option><option>Me and a few others</option><option>A small team</option><option>Not sur